{"seq":1,"slug":"race-conditions","title":"竞态条件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/supplementary/race-conditions","wordCount":770,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"竞态条件\">竞态条件</h1><h2 id=\"问题描述\">问题描述</h2><p><strong>竞态条件（Race Condition）</strong> 是指多个并发执行的线程或进程，在没有适当同步的情况下，同时访问和操作共享数据，导致程序结果依赖于执行的先后顺序——而这个顺序是不确定的。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>竞态条件是并发编程中最常见、最隐蔽的错误之一。程序可能在大部分时间&quot;正常&quot;运行，但偶尔产生错误结果，且难以稳定复现。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant T1 as Thread A&#10;    participant MEM as Shared Variable&lt;br/&gt;counter = 0&#10;    participant T2 as Thread B&#10;&#10;    T1-&gt;&gt;MEM: Read counter (gets 0)&#10;    T2-&gt;&gt;MEM: Read counter (gets 0)&#10;    T1-&gt;&gt;MEM: Write counter = 0 + 1 = 1&#10;    T2-&gt;&gt;MEM: Write counter = 0 + 1 = 1&#10;    Note over MEM: Result: counter = 1 ❌&lt;br/&gt;Expected: counter = 2 ✅\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant T1 as Thread A\n    participant MEM as Shared Variable&lt;br/&gt;counter = 0\n    participant T2 as Thread B\n\n    T1-&gt;&gt;MEM: Read counter (gets 0)\n    T2-&gt;&gt;MEM: Read counter (gets 0)\n    T1-&gt;&gt;MEM: Write counter = 0 + 1 = 1\n    T2-&gt;&gt;MEM: Write counter = 0 + 1 = 1\n    Note over MEM: Result: counter = 1 ❌&lt;br/&gt;Expected: counter = 2 ✅</pre><p>两个线程各自加 1，期望结果是 2，实际结果却是 1——因为线程 B 读取时还未看到线程 A 的写入。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"竞态条件的本质\">竞态条件的本质</h3><p>竞态条件的根本原因在于<strong>非原子操作</strong>：一个逻辑上应该不可分割的操作，在实际执行时被分解为多个步骤，而这些步骤之间可能被其他线程插入。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    OP[&quot;Logical Operation: counter++&quot;] --&gt; S1[&quot;Step 1: Read the value of counter&quot;]&#10;    S1 --&gt; S2[&quot;Step 2: Value + 1&quot;]&#10;    S2 --&gt; S3[&quot;Step 3: Write back to counter&quot;]&#10;    S1 -.-&gt;|&quot;⚠️ Other threads may interleave here&quot;| S2&#10;    S2 -.-&gt;|&quot;⚠️ Other threads may interleave here&quot;| S3\">flowchart TD\n    OP[\"Logical Operation: counter++\"] --&gt; S1[\"Step 1: Read the value of counter\"]\n    S1 --&gt; S2[\"Step 2: Value + 1\"]\n    S2 --&gt; S3[\"Step 3: Write back to counter\"]\n    S1 -.-&gt;|\"⚠️ Other threads may interleave here\"| S2\n    S2 -.-&gt;|\"⚠️ Other threads may interleave here\"| S3</pre><h3 id=\"竞态条件的类型\">竞态条件的类型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">类型</th>\n<th align=\"left\">说明</th>\n<th align=\"left\">示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>读-改-写（Read-Modify-Write）</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">读取值 → 修改 → 写回，中间被插入</td>\n<td align=\"left\">计数器递增</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>检查-执行（Check-Then-Act）</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">先检查条件 → 基于结果执行，条件可能已变</td>\n<td align=\"left\">文件存在性检查后写入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>复合操作</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">多个独立操作需要作为整体原子执行</td>\n<td align=\"left\">转账：扣款 + 入账</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"典型场景\">典型场景</h2><h3 id=\"场景一-读-改-写-read-modify-write\">场景一：读-改-写（Read-Modify-Write）</h3><p>这是最经典的竞态条件模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"共享变量 balance = 1000&#10;&#10;线程A（取款 500）:&#10;    temp = 读取 balance          // temp = 1000&#10;    // ⚠️ 此时线程B也在执行&#10;    temp = temp - 500            // temp = 500&#10;    写入 balance = temp          // balance = 500&#10;&#10;线程B（取款 300）:&#10;    temp = 读取 balance          // temp = 1000（读到了旧值！）&#10;    temp = temp - 300            // temp = 700&#10;    写入 balance = temp          // balance = 700 ❌&#10;&#10;// 最终 balance = 700，但实际应该是 200\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>共享变量 balance = 1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>线程A（取款 500）:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    temp = 读取 balance          // temp = 1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // ⚠️ 此时线程B也在执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    temp = temp - 500            // temp = 500</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    写入 balance = temp          // balance = 500</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>线程B（取款 300）:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    temp = 读取 balance          // temp = 1000（读到了旧值！）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    temp = temp - 300            // temp = 700</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    写入 balance = temp          // balance = 700 ❌</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 最终 balance = 700，但实际应该是 200</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant A as Thread A (Withdraw 500)&#10;    participant BAL as balance = 1000&#10;    participant B as Thread B (Withdraw 300)&#10;&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;BAL: Read balance = 1000&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;BAL: Read balance = 1000&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;BAL: Write balance = 500&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;BAL: Write balance = 700&#10;    Note over BAL: Final balance = 700 ❌&lt;br/&gt;Thread A&#39;s update is lost\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant A as Thread A (Withdraw 500)\n    participant BAL as balance = 1000\n    participant B as Thread B (Withdraw 300)\n\n    A-&gt;&gt;BAL: Read balance = 1000\n    B-&gt;&gt;BAL: Read balance = 1000\n    A-&gt;&gt;BAL: Write balance = 500\n    B-&gt;&gt;BAL: Write balance = 700\n    Note over BAL: Final balance = 700 ❌&lt;br/&gt;Thread A's update is lost</pre><h3 id=\"场景二-检查-执行-check-then-act\">场景二：检查-执行（Check-Then-Act）</h3><p>先检查某个条件，再基于检查结果执行操作。问题在于检查和执行之间存在时间窗口。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"共享变量 tickets = 1   // 仅剩 1 张票&#10;&#10;线程A:&#10;    如果 tickets &gt; 0:        // 检查: true&#10;        // ⚠️ 线程B同时通过了检查&#10;        tickets = tickets - 1 // 执行: tickets = 0&#10;        打印 &quot;购票成功&quot;&#10;&#10;线程B:&#10;    如果 tickets &gt; 0:        // 检查: true（此时还没减）&#10;        tickets = tickets - 1 // 执行: tickets = -1 ❌&#10;        打印 &quot;购票成功&quot;&#10;&#10;// 两个线程都&quot;成功&quot;购票，但实际只有 1 张票\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>共享变量 tickets = 1   // 仅剩 1 张票</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>线程A:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    如果 tickets > 0:        // 检查: true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // ⚠️ 线程B同时通过了检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        tickets = tickets - 1 // 执行: tickets = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        打印 \"购票成功\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>线程B:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    如果 tickets > 0:        // 检查: true（此时还没减）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        tickets = tickets - 1 // 执行: tickets = -1 ❌</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        打印 \"购票成功\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 两个线程都\"成功\"购票，但实际只有 1 张票</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"场景三-复合操作\">场景三：复合操作</h3><p>多个操作需要作为整体执行，但中间被其他线程打断：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// 转账操作：应该是原子的&#10;函数 transfer(from, to, amount):&#10;    如果 from.balance &gt;= amount:&#10;        from.balance = from.balance - amount&#10;        // ⚠️ 如果此处发生线程切换&#10;        // 另一个线程可能看到不一致的状态&#10;        // （钱已扣但未到账）&#10;        to.balance = to.balance + amount\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 转账操作：应该是原子的</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>函数 transfer(from, to, amount):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    如果 from.balance >= amount:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        from.balance = from.balance - amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // ⚠️ 如果此处发生线程切换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 另一个线程可能看到不一致的状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // （钱已扣但未到账）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        to.balance = to.balance + amount</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"解决方案\">解决方案</h2><h3 id=\"方案概览\">方案概览</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    RACE[&quot;Race Condition&quot;] --&gt; S1[&quot;Mutex&lt;br/&gt;Mutex&quot;]&#10;    RACE --&gt; S2[&quot;Atomic Operations&lt;br/&gt;Atomic&quot;]&#10;    RACE --&gt; S3[&quot;Immutable Data&lt;br/&gt;Immutable&quot;]&#10;    RACE --&gt; S4[&quot;Message Passing&lt;br/&gt;Actor/CSP&quot;]&#10;    RACE --&gt; S5[&quot;Thread-Local Storage&lt;br/&gt;Thread-Local&quot;]&#10;    S1 --&gt; R1[&quot;Protect Critical Section&lt;br/&gt;Only one thread at a time&quot;]&#10;    S2 --&gt; R2[&quot;Hardware-Level Guarantee&lt;br/&gt;Indivisible operations&quot;]&#10;    S3 --&gt; R3[&quot;Data Cannot Be Modified&lt;br/&gt;No synchronization needed&quot;]&#10;    S4 --&gt; R4[&quot;No Shared State&lt;br/&gt;Communicate via messages&quot;]&#10;    S5 --&gt; R5[&quot;Independent Copy Per Thread&lt;br/&gt;No interference&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    RACE[\"Race Condition\"] --&gt; S1[\"Mutex&lt;br/&gt;Mutex\"]\n    RACE --&gt; S2[\"Atomic Operations&lt;br/&gt;Atomic\"]\n    RACE --&gt; S3[\"Immutable Data&lt;br/&gt;Immutable\"]\n    RACE --&gt; S4[\"Message Passing&lt;br/&gt;Actor/CSP\"]\n    RACE --&gt; S5[\"Thread-Local Storage&lt;br/&gt;Thread-Local\"]\n    S1 --&gt; R1[\"Protect Critical Section&lt;br/&gt;Only one thread at a time\"]\n    S2 --&gt; R2[\"Hardware-Level Guarantee&lt;br/&gt;Indivisible operations\"]\n    S3 --&gt; R3[\"Data Cannot Be Modified&lt;br/&gt;No synchronization needed\"]\n    S4 --&gt; R4[\"No Shared State&lt;br/&gt;Communicate via messages\"]\n    S5 --&gt; R5[\"Independent Copy Per Thread&lt;br/&gt;No interference\"]</pre><h3 id=\"方案对比\">方案对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">方案</th>\n<th align=\"left\">原理</th>\n<th align=\"left\">优点</th>\n<th align=\"left\">缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>互斥锁</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">对临界区加锁，保证互斥访问</td>\n<td align=\"left\">通用，适用范围广</td>\n<td align=\"left\">可能引发死锁、性能开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>原子操作</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">硬件保证操作不可分割</td>\n<td align=\"left\">性能高，无锁</td>\n<td align=\"left\">只适用于简单操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>不可变数据</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">数据创建后不可修改</td>\n<td align=\"left\">天然线程安全</td>\n<td align=\"left\">修改时需创建新副本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>消息传递</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">用消息代替共享内存</td>\n<td align=\"left\">从设计上消除竞态</td>\n<td align=\"left\">编程模型不同，有学习成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>线程局部存储</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">每个线程持有独立副本</td>\n<td align=\"left\">无需同步</td>\n<td align=\"left\">无法在线程间共享</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"使用锁保护的示例\">使用锁保护的示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"共享变量 balance = 1000&#10;互斥锁 balance_lock&#10;&#10;线程A（取款 500）:&#10;    获取锁(balance_lock)&#10;        temp = 读取 balance        // temp = 1000&#10;        temp = temp - 500&#10;        写入 balance = temp        // balance = 500&#10;    释放锁(balance_lock)&#10;&#10;线程B（取款 300）:&#10;    获取锁(balance_lock)           // 阻塞，等待线程A释放&#10;        temp = 读取 balance        // temp = 500&#10;        temp = temp - 300&#10;        写入 balance = temp        // balance = 200 ✅&#10;    释放锁(balance_lock)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>共享变量 balance = 1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>互斥锁 balance_lock</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>线程A（取款 500）:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    获取锁(balance_lock)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        temp = 读取 balance        // temp = 1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        temp = temp - 500</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        写入 balance = temp        // balance = 500</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    释放锁(balance_lock)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>线程B（取款 300）:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    获取锁(balance_lock)           // 阻塞，等待线程A释放</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        temp = 读取 balance        // temp = 500</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        temp = temp - 300</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        写入 balance = temp        // balance = 200 ✅</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    释放锁(balance_lock)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"使用原子操作的示例\">使用原子操作的示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface AtomicCounter {&#10;  value: number;&#10;  compareAndSwap(expected: number, newValue: number): boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function increment(counter: AtomicCounter): void {&#10;  let success = false;&#10;  while (!success) {&#10;    const current = counter.value;&#10;    success = counter.compareAndSwap(current, current + 1);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AtomicCounter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  compareAndSwap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">expected</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">newValue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> increment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">counter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AtomicCounter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> success </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">success) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> current</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> counter.value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    success </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> counter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">compareAndSwap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(current, current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>竞态条件是并发编程中最常见的正确性问题，核心要点如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>本质</strong>：非原子操作在并发执行时被交错，导致结果依赖于不确定的执行顺序</li>\n<li><strong>两大经典模式</strong>：读-改-写（Read-Modify-Write）和检查-执行（Check-Then-Act）</li>\n<li><strong>危害</strong>：程序表面运行正常，但偶尔产生不一致结果，极难复现和调试</li>\n<li><strong>解决思路</strong>：互斥锁（加锁保护）、原子操作（硬件保证）、不可变数据（消除修改）、消息传递（消除共享）</li>\n<li>最根本的防御策略是<strong>减少共享可变状态</strong>——无共享则无竞态</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"l